Pax Americana is a Beyond Typus Addon that reworks and expands the map of North America and South America
New Update 1.5: The New Colossus
- Completely reworked map of Brazil
 - 121 New Provinces in North Brazil
 - 164 New Provinces in South Brazil
- Completely reworked map of Amazon
 - 78 New Provinces in Brazilian Amazon
 - 18 New Provinces in Bolivian Amazon
- Finished reworked map of Guyanas
 - 4 New provinces
- Fixed some Jank in Vanilla South America not reworked yet.
- Enlarged the Map to fit with BT's new map
- 2 New Trade Nodes, Sao Paulo and Goias
- 4 New Colonial Regions, Paulistania, Guyana, Pernambuco, and Amazon
- 7 New Monuments in Brazil
- Added more colonial cultures to South America
- Added New World African Cultures for South America

!!! Requires Beyond Typus 17.1 to work

Pax Americana is compatible with Byzantine Resurgence

Reworked and Expanded Map of North America
Reworked and Expanded Map of the Caribbean Islands
Reworked and Expanded Map of Gran Colombia
Reworked and Expanded Map of Brazil
Added Around 1250 New Provinces
Reworked and Expanded Map of Eastern Canada courtesy of Good Lookin
Updated National Ideas for USA
Updated and Expanded government reforms for USA
Updated Mission Tree for USA
Several new Monuments!

I tried to Find native names for every provinces, but had to make compromises in several places. If you have a good historical source for the name of a province, please let me know!

